              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Components, layout templates and specs for AI-generated canvases in mainPanel — one canvas per answered question, each saveable. Dark is the default theme. Colors, sizes and spacing bind Hemlock tokens (g:); 02 Component Tokens flags every value that doesn't. UI type uses the local font-ui token (Gothic A1, exploration); editorial type uses g:font-secondary (Noto Serif).",
