                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Container · gap spacing-xs\nHeader · gap spacing-md · Type / Label in sem-text-header · legend of Canvas / Legend Items (gap spacing-sm)\nLegend sample · chart-categorical/color-01 line · chart-categorical/color-02 swatch, radius-4xs\nPlot slot · a Hemlock chart, /no-card variant\nPlaceholder plot · gridlines sem-borders-dark · baseline sem-borders-strong\nPlaceholder series · line chart-categorical/color-01 2.5 · area chart-categorical/color-01 → #00000000 at 25%\nAxis · padding [0, 6] · Type / Meta\nCaption · Type / Caption",
                      "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-xs",
