                      "width": 520,
                      "content": "Gridlines are sem-borders-dark and the baseline is sem-borders-strong. Hemlock charts use sem-borders-light (grid) and sem-borders-dark (axis line).\nThe area fades to #00000000 at 25%. Hemlock's AreaChart uses chart-sequential/seq-300 → seq-100 at 50%, with a seq-500 line at 2.\nAxis padding 6 is off the spacing scale.\nHemlock's chart rules put the legend at the bottom and the chart on sem-background-elevated. Here the legend is in the header and the chart sits on sem-background-main.",
