              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Conversations replace the CANVASES section. The list sits below YOUR MONEY and fills the rest of the nav. Hovering a row shows a drag handle and the system grab cursor, so moving is implied: drag the handle and the row lifts and slides over its neighbors. Clicking the handle also picks the row up, and a second click drops it, so moving never requires dragging. The More menu holds only Rename, which edits the title in place, and Remove, which takes the row out right away with Undo in a toast.",
