              "content": "Replaces the Chat / Canvas Link card. Each AI reply that makes a canvas posts this chip under its text; clicking it scrolls the feed to the canvas and moves focus to the canvas title. The arrow comes first because the feed sits to the left of the chat panel, then the canvas name in caps, then its type icon (report: layout-dashboard, plan: list-checks). The chip hugs its label; past the chat column the name truncates with an ellipsis.",
