              "content": "The answer area of the Q&A question card. Each control is a component whose root fills the card's width, so it drops into the card's answer slot at any feed width; pills and radios keep their own size inside it. The card itself (QUESTION N, the question, helper text, Skip / Continue) is designed separately. Everything is built from Hemlock Button, Radio, Checkbox, and Slider instances, with labels overridden to font-ui. A selected choice keeps Hemlock's pressed-outline look at rest, the same rule as Canvas / Save Button / Saved. Backdrops stand in for the card's content area: Hemlock Card tokens, 488 wide inside, as in the feed.",
