    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "cxYtO",
      "x": 11680,
      "y": 7058,
      "name": "Q&A template — behavior (v2)",
      "width": 340,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "Q&A template — behavior (v2)\n\nWhen: the model picks the q&a template when it needs facts it doesn't have, such as building a detailed plan. One question at a time, in the feed. Shown in \"View - D - Q&A v2 · Follow-ups inline\" and the mobile version.\n\nQuestion cards:\n• Current: 2px sem-borders-action, shadow-md, Skip and Continue. Continue stays disabled until the answer is valid; Skip records \"skipped\" and moves on.\n• Answered: dimmed to 60% (\"been there, done that\"), no actions. Click to reopen and change it.\n• Upcoming main questions aren't shown. Queued follow-ups are, as one-line Up next cards, so people see how many are left.\n• The Answer slot takes one Q&A / Answer control or a Hemlock Input for short text.\n• TALK is on hold (hidden for now).\n• Type: main questions are text-size-lg / line-height-lg (Hemlock: section titles, card headers). Follow-ups step down to text-size-md / line-height-md (Q&A / Question Card / Follow-up). The page title stays the only xl.\n\nFollow-ups replace branches. When an answer needs more detail (each checked income source, a spouse), the follow-up questions are inserted right after it as real, numbered questions in the same flow. A Q&A / Follow-up Group holds them: a note under the parent (\"↳ 3 follow-ups from your answer\") and an indented thread. Each follow-up's label names its topic (\"QUESTION 8 · SOCIAL SECURITY\"). Ask one question per topic where possible; question 6 now only asks which sources apply, and each follow-up asks for the amount or date.\n\nDepth: one level of follow-ups. A second level only if it's unavoidable, indented once more on the same thread. Never deeper.\n\nChanging an answer: reopening a parent and unchecking a source removes its follow-up, with a short \"1 follow-up removed\" note in place of it. Checking a new one inserts its follow-up and moves the current question there.\n\nProgress: Q&A / Progress shows \"Question 8 of 15\" and how many were added from answers. The total grows or shrinks as follow-ups come and go.\n\nAccessibility: each card is a fieldset whose legend is the question. Answered cards are buttons that reopen them. The follow-up group is a list labelled by its note. After Continue, focus moves to the next question's legend, and a polite live region announces added or removed follow-ups.\n\nGen-UI JSON (sketch):\n{ \"template\": \"qa\", \"questions\": [ { \"id\": \"q6\", \"prompt\": \"Do you have investment or other outside income?\", \"answer\": { \"type\": \"multi-select\", \"options\": [\"dividends\", \"rental\", \"pension\", \"social-security\", \"business\", \"other\"] }, \"followUps\": [ { \"when\": { \"selected\": \"social-security\" }, \"id\": \"q6-ss\", \"topic\": \"Social Security\", \"prompt\": \"When do you plan to start Social Security?\", \"answer\": { \"type\": \"number-stepper\", \"unit\": \"years old\" } } ] } ] }"
    },
