              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Hemlock has no brand or accent role, so its blue is sem-*-action: the link and button color. Eight canvas components borrow it for decoration or labels. That teaches people that blue isn't always clickable, and it pulls attention from the real links. Each row shows the component now and a proposed copy that swaps in an existing non-action Hemlock role; the originals are unchanged. Kept blue on purpose: Text Link (it is an action), the Skeleton spinner (system activity), and two current-state markers, the active Plan Step rule and the Timeline's today dot, which follow Hemlock's own Steps.",
              "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
