              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Where it landed is at the top: ranks get a soft square with a semibold serif numeral, numbered lists keep the round Number Marker, and takeaways drop numbers for an icon picked by meaning (06). Sections 01–05 are the explorations that got there; 04's numbered takeaways are superseded. Everything binds a Hemlock token. Nothing on this board is on the live screens yet: Ranked Row (G1aer3) and Takeaway (y3LxQD) are unchanged.",
              "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
